      "chunk_id": "a3d2beee-aea8-4d4f-bbf7-07017884bf45",
      "content": "Parental Leave Summary\n\nEligible full-time employees may receive up to 12 weeks of company-supported parental leave after 6 months of service. Local statutory benefits may apply separately. Employees should contact People Operations at least 60 days before the expected leave date when possible.\n\nThis document provides a company policy summary and does not provide legal advice.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "fa90b82b-0125-4233-b659-2881d28a2633",
      "content": "Policy Ownership\n\nPeople Operations owns the employee handbook, PTO and leave policy, benefits overview, and remote work policy. HR Admins are responsible for maintaining document versions, effective dates, and review cycles.\n\nPolicy updates require review by People Operations, Legal, and the executive owner when the update affects employee obligations, leave eligibility, benefits access, or employee relations workflows.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "HR Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "28c160c7-c933-449e-a731-748b6ee201ec",
      "content": "Policy Maintenance\n\nEach HR policy should be reviewed at least annually. Changes must include a version number, effective date, owner, and summary of material changes.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002002",
      "document_id": "HR-ADMIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4d0ae131-80d4-4c78-b6cf-7523be37c236",
      "content": "Sick Leave\n\nEmployees receive 8 paid sick days per calendar year. Sick time may be used for personal illness, medical appointments, or short-term caregiving needs. Employees should notify their manager as soon as practical when taking sick leave.\n\nMedical details should not be shared in team channels. People Operations may request documentation only when required by policy or law.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "50227ee4-84db-49ca-b46e-df7b730ecc0e",
      "content": "Missing Policy Areas\n\nNorthstar does not publish a sabbatical policy in the employee knowledge base. Employees asking about sabbaticals should contact People Operations.",
